1
00:00:00,702 --> 00:00:04,372
(Amy:)I'm going to the vending
machine. Do you want anything?

2
00:00:04,372 --> 00:00:07,002
(Sheldon:)This is a simulation.
We have to survive

3
00:00:07,008 --> 00:00:08,338
(Sheldon:)on the supplies we brought.

4
00:00:08,343 --> 00:00:10,943
(Amy:)Okay, just checking.

5
00:00:10,945 --> 00:00:13,845
(Raj:)We should have asked her
to get some Funyuns.

6
00:00:13,848 --> 00:00:15,848
(Sheldon:)You're not going to have Funyuns

7
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:18,180
(Sheldon:)when we're a mile
below the surface of the Earth.

8
00:00:18,186 --> 00:00:19,786
(Raj:)What if we brought them down
with us?

9
00:00:20,755 --> 00:00:23,455
(Sheldon:)We'll take some Funyuns.

10
00:00:23,458 --> 00:00:25,428
(Amy:)Anything else?

11
00:00:25,427 --> 00:00:28,127
(Sheldon:)Some York Peppermint Patties,

12
00:00:28,129 --> 00:00:29,799
(Penny:)a couple
of Dr. Peppers, and...

13
00:00:29,798 --> 00:00:32,598
(Sheldon:)run to Best Buy and see if
they have a portable DVD player

14
00:00:32,600 --> 00:00:36,140
(Sheldon:)and season one of a show
called Hannah Montana.

15
00:00:36,137 --> 00:00:38,607
(Rajj:)Have her get season two.

16
00:00:38,606 --> 00:00:41,306
(Sheldon:)Season one,
it was still finding itself.

17
00:00:42,610 --> 00:00:44,980
(Bernadette:)Sorry you guys
had to see that.
Oh,

18
00:00:44,979 --> 00:00:46,309
(Penny:)don't apologize.
Yeah.

19
00:00:46,314 --> 00:00:49,754
(Leonard:)It just makes it a lot harder
to pretend it never happened.

20
00:00:49,751 --> 00:00:51,881
(Bernadette:)Money's a sensitive subject
for Howie

21
00:00:51,886 --> 00:00:53,816
(Bernadette:)because of the difference
in our income.

22
00:00:53,822 --> 00:00:55,122
(Penny:)It really bothers him?

23
00:00:55,123 --> 00:00:56,293
(Bernadette:)Well, sure.
There's still a lot of pressure

24
00:00:56,291 --> 00:00:57,761
(Bernadette:)on guys to be providers.

